{"articleNo":"187629","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=187629&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2018 KGSP Admission Call for Graduate School Studying at kit, Korea","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.02.06","hit":"3277","attachments":[{"name":"★2018 KGSP-G Application Form.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=187629&attachNo=77414"},{"name":"★2018 KGSP-G Application FAQs (ENGLISH-KOREAN).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=187629&attachNo=77425"},{"name":"★2018 KGSP-G Application Guidelines (Korean).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=187629&attachNo=77446"},{"name":"★2018 KGSP-G Application Guidelines (English).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=187629&attachNo=77473"},{"name":"★2018 Available Fields of Study_kit.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=187629&attachNo=78568"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2018 </font><span style=\"COLOR: blue\">KGSP Admission Call</span><font color=\"#000000\"> for Graduate School Studying at kit, Korea<!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></font></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%\"><font color=\"#000000\">We are pleased to inform you of 2018 KGSP (Korean Government Scholarship Program) Guideline for Master’s and Doctoral candidates here in Korea. <o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%\">As the one and only national engineering specialized university in Korea, we will be able to nominate candidates up to 25. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">This might be a great opportunity for you to be able to study in Korea with a full government scholarship.<o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><font color=\"#000000\">Please see attached for further information and if there are any candidates interested in this program, please send me </font><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><u><span style=\"COLOR: red\">one original application document package </span></u></b></span><b><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">no later than March 23<sup>rd</sup> (Friday) 2018</span></u></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">. Your original application documents must be delivered to my office by the deadline. <b><o:p></o:p></b></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><font color=\"#000000\">1. Applicants' GPA must be more than 2.64 on a 4.0 scale, 2.80 on a 4.3 scale, 2.91 on a 4.5 scale, 3.23 on a 5.0 scale, or score percentile of 80% from your university (Exception: A former or current KGSP scholar must hold the grade of 90% or above)<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">2. Applicants who submit applications to more than two designated institutions will be disqualified.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">3. Scholarship duration: Master's(1 yr. of Korean Language + 2 yrs. of Master'), Doctoral(1 yr. of Korean Language + 3 yrs. of Doctoral)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">4. Applicants must be under 40 years of age as of Sep.1st, 2018(born after Sep. 1, 1978).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">5. In case of submitting photocopied documents, applicants MUST have the copies notarized or apostilled and then submit the notarized or apostilled copies. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">All required documents must be written by computer typing and send us one original document by post only (no e-mail application will be accepted). We don’t have online application for this KGSP admission. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">For further information, please see attached, visit website (</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\">http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">) or contact KGSP coordinator, Eugene Park. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">Submission Deadline</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">: 23<sup>rd</sup> March 2018<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">Submission address</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">: <o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">61 Daehak-ro, Gumi, Gyeongbuk, Korea, <o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">Kumoh 